Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[WALT PANTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.07,0:01:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[JESSE COUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT: Oh, God. Please.\NJESSE: Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[BRAKES SQUEALING]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bold plan, Mr. White.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure this\Nis the way to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.95,0:02:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NGracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOB JAMES' "FEEL LIKE\NMAKING LOVE" PLAYlNG OVER PA]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NYou see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[PEOPLE CHATTERlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER: What does he remember?\NMAN: Not a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He came in dehydrated\Nand disoriented,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but once we gave him fluids\Nhe stabilized pretty quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NBut I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows where he is?\NMAN: Oh, yes, yes. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only the last day or so\Nthat seem to be missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on in.\NHe's probably awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Walter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH SOBBlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,WALTER:\NI'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who\NI am, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, son.\NI know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.81,0:04:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.\NGive your old man a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. l...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, l mean, in...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The past couple days are missing,\Nbut other than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My God, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What a day this\Nhas been, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.89,0:05:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Uncle Hank,\Nhe was in a shootout?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A shootout?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed some guy.\NSome big drug dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Hank\Nwasted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.\NIs he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NAbsolutely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did this happen?\NHow could he--?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re all okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We' ll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.33,0:05:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,MARIE [OVER PHONE]:\NAnd no idea what caused it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.17,0:05:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're gonna run\Na whole series of tests, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:06:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But what could it be?\NI mean, did they give you\Na worst-case scenario?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I really...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, there's no point\Nin getting ahead of ourselves, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, which supermarket?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it, like, a big one?\NLike, a chain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I-- Don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's just great that, you know,\Nhe's back and he' s feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I just-- l mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He-- Naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He was naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In a supermarket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Whole Foods, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, l'm gonna get\Nover there as soon as l can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. Don't worry about it\Nright now, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Hank?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I ran over here\Nand l got to see him all of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,30 seconds before\Nthey yanked him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you' d think\Ntoday of all days
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,they' d let him\Ngo home on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is he? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's indestructible,\Nyou know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I identified myself and told\Nthe suspect to show his hands,\Nturn and face me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, I identified\Nthe suspect as Mr. Salamanca
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and observed what\Nappeared to be a gunshot\Nwound in his midsection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He was shot previous\Nto your arrival?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Again I instructed him\Nto show his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Salamanca lunged\Ntoward the vehicle
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and fired on me with\Nwhat I ascertained to be\Nan M1 6 assault rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I returned fire\Nand sought cover
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,as Mr. Salamanca proceeded\Nto engage me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.23,0:07:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,When he paused to reload,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to take\Nan effective shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Agent Schrader, what were\Nyou doing in a shooting fight\Non your own, with no backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Salamanca' s presence\Nwas not something I'd anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:07:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was tending to another matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What other matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,An unrelated family matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching for your brother-in-law,\Nas l understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.47,0:08:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother-in-law?\NYes, sir. He's since been found.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fine. The whole thing\Nwas a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But at the time, he'd been\Nmissing for several hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and since he's in poor health,\Nthe whole family was concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was talking to his friends\Nand acquaintances,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to get a fix\Non his whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Monte Carlo at the scene\Nbelonged to a former student of his,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,a Jesse Pinkman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was tracking down\NMr. Pinkman's car when I\Ncame across Mr. Salamanca.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about this Pinkman?\NWhat was his car doing at the\Ncrime scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you run him down yet?\NNot yet, but we're working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[INDlSTlNCT RADlO CHATTER]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.81,0:09:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,BADGER:\NMan, they're like\NJehovah' s Witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.19,0:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.\NWhy don' t they just\Nkick your door down?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They need probable cause.\NProbable cause?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, what did you do?\NRob a bank?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you,\Nthis is serious shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm like an outlaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[CAR DRIVES AWAY]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.06,0:09:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re Willy Wonka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Willy Wonka,\Nand l got the golden ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Put me on your\Nmagical boat, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail me down your\Nchocolaty river of meth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So where you keep\Nthe pseudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a P2P cook. That barrel?\NAqueous methylamine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, you don't need pseudo.\NCome on, help me out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No pseudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.67,0:10:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to me, beautiful baby.\NI'm gonna be so good to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.\NJust take this, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.93,0:10:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't just let you\Nbreak this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that'd be sacrilege.\NI told you, that's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw the cops. Right?\NSure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.35,0:10:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But couldn't we just\Ncook one quick batch?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, for the road?\NNo, forget it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This stuff has to go, like, now.\NDude, you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we're cool and all,\Nbut I ain't forgetting you just\Nleft me stranded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,God, Badger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH GRUNTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NOh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.49,0:11:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH PANTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This was a bad choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOTOR WHIRRING]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure about this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.63,0:11:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,BADGER:\NHe's totally, totally cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, what'd we say, 500?\NWe didn't say, and it's 1 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousand bucks?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, where you\Ntowing it, man, Seattle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain' t the miles,\Nit' s the cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l mean,\Nall I got on me is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[JESSE SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,560.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:11:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?\NJESSE: Hey-- No--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Clovis, he'll pay you\Nthe rest later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's totally good for it.\NJesse's a stand-up dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That right?\NYou a stand-up dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.67,0:12:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I will get you the other 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Five hundred more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your word' s\Nyour bond, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved your\Nskinny ass, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally vouched\Nfor you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you\Ndoing now, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you like\Ntwo hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and then l'm calling on\Na pay phone, not a cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re not using your own name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.82,0:12:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, obviously.\NLook, dude, I'll do, like,\Nwhat you said, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you gotta\Ngo and do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They need probable cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the last thing\Nyou remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.77,0:13:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, l was driving home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.61,0:13:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NDo you remember\Ncoming home?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.20,0:13:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You came in, and I asked\Nwhy you were out of breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't remember talking to me\Nwhen l was in the bathtub?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry, l don' t.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing else?\NNo fleeting images?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, no. l, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I was--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was walking down\Nsome road or highway
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.77,0:13:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,with a lot of headlights,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and l remember feeling fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.61,0:13:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. That' s it.\NAll right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's definitely\Nsome good news here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The MRl shows no metastases.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning the cancer\Nhasn't spread to the brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're looking\Nreally good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what was it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,SOPER:\NWell, there's no sign\Nof stroke or seizure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And considering your condition,\Nthe blood panel looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we talking about?\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As of right now, we really
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,can' t say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.\NGranted, this is not my field,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but isn' t it possible\Nthat this had something to do
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,with all the prescriptions\NI've been taking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the antiemetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,the antitussive,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the this, the that.\NNot to mention the chemo itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem. And being off all of them\Nfor the past few days, I have to say
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.71,0:14:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and, you know,\Nwhen we pick up these\Nmedications,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:15:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the information sheets\Nare as long as your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's page after page\Nof side effects and warnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, exactly.\NCould it be that simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we' ll take\Nanother look at that, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, I understand that you've been\Nkind of stressed out lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stressed out? I--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think l'm--\NSKYLER: Walt, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stressed out\Nis putting it mildly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l guess I've had a lot\Non my mind lately, but as I've said,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we be talking about\Nwhen l can get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that may still be\Na ways down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A ways down the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think our next move is\Nto schedule a psychiatric evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.93,0:15:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, is that absolutely\Nnecessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, nobody likes being\Nin the hospital. l get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.27,0:15:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But until we know\Nwhat caused this incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we can' t be certain\Nit won't recur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[TOlLET FLUSHES]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That your last hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.07,0:16:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NAll right, finish it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[CAN OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.35,0:17:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[WENDY SCREAMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,AGENT: Show your hands.\NGet on your stomach now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.36,0:17:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your stomach now!\NGet over. Roll! Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[WENDY GASPING]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NI'm going, I' m going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse Pinkman, I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[HANDS DRUMMING]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What, man?\NHANK: Tell me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's there to tell, okay?\NHer and I were partying, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.49,0:18:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Saturday night?\NPartying for three days\Nstraight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bumping uglies\Nand smoking that crystal\Nyou got from your pal, Tuco?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Taco? l don' t know any Taco,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and l damn sure didn't say\Nanything about no crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days,\Nyou must have got hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, l guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK: You order take-out?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, where from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You get yourself a little\Nof that moo goo gai pan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.43,0:18:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,from that chink place\Naround the corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, we didn't. We got stuff\Nfrom the vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Funyuns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a Hot Pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Funyuns and Hot Pockets?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't notice your car\Nwas gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not until you guys went\Nand busted down the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now, who's gonna\Npay for that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Management's gonna\Nbe on my ass for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.03,0:18:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you weren't\Nanswering your cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:19:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was in my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That right?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We found your car,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but your phone wasn' t in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you found my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You found my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome.\NDEA all the way. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're talking\Nabout missing property,\Ndid you, um...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you leave anything else\Nin the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what? Like, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.66,0:19:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[SNIFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.91,0:19:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixty-seven thousand,\Nnine hundred and 20 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NThat's not yours? Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.75,0:19:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He says it's not his, Gomie.\NGOMEZ: Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NGee, I really thought\Nthis might be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.18,0:19:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Unclaimed drug money,\Nhuh? Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what we got here,\NGomie, don' t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a new interdiction van\Nright there, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely some new\Nsoftball jerseys, because\Nwe need them, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing Tuco's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.69,0:20:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost this kind of money,\NI'd wanna kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So who' s your chief,\Nlittle lnjun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.57,0:20:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that even mean?\NIt means l think your story's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you know\Nwho Tuco Salamanca was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think your car was there\Nbecause you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuco had a bullet in him\Nwhen l got there and I think you\Nknow something about that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are you\Nsaying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I shot someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.34,0:20:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With, like, a gun?\NYou?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Only shooting you do\Nis into a Kleenex.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.43,0:20:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think you know\Nthe badass who did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.73,0:20:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l was partying\Nwith Wendy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Funyuns and boom-boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:20:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.07,0:21:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what.\NWe' re gonna, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.49,0:21:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,go talk to that skinny yeast factory\Nof a girlfriend you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a feeling she's gonna,\Nyou know, roll on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my root beer?\NCome on. l gotta pee,\Nand l got low blood sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.95,0:21:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I got medical issues.\NMedical issues?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.16,0:21:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, what kind\Nof medical issues?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.37,0:21:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You got penis withdrawal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You got schlongus\Ninterruptus?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wendy, listen.\NTalk to me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and you get a root beer\Nand a tinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, tell me the last three days.\NI told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.25,0:21:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,we were shacked up\Nsince Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.97,0:22:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of you left the room?\NNot even for a little, little minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.97,0:22:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,For a second?\NI don't know, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.48,0:22:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Jesse leave the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.31,0:22:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He did, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wendy, you can do it.\NYou can do it, Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wendy, Wendy, Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you wanna go back\Nto giving windys, Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.66,0:22:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you. l know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.33,0:22:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re the one in the black truck.\NYou wanted me to do that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,GOMEZ: What?\NThe kid with the crutches.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The football player.\NHow about we stay on topic?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.34,0:22:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Jesse came over to the palace\Nat 1 1 :00 Saturday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.68,0:22:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We were together the whole time,\Nand he never left the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And that' s all\NI'm saying about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.02,0:22:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my root beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.94,0:23:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,GOMEZ: You wanted her\Nto bang a football player,\Nyou big, bald pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long story, Gomie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l'm sure it is,\Nand l wanna hear it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.86,0:23:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but first we gotta kick\NPinkman loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet. I got one more shot\Nat that little skid mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.08,0:23:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,CHAVEZ:\NAnd how are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.34,0:23:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, fine. Most nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.38,0:23:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.88,0:23:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed any\Nrecurring thoughts or images,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.43,0:23:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,things you can't\Nget out of your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.39,0:23:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How about feelings of guilt\Nor persecution?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Look, doctor,\NI don't mean to be rude,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.65,0:23:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but where is this going,\Nexactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.61,0:23:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re starting a process, Walt.\NAn ongoing process.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.24,0:23:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you prefer Walt or Walter?\NOngoing for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.12,0:23:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just met you.\NIt's hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.66,0:23:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We could be talking about days,\Nweeks, months.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.29,0:24:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, doctor, l feel fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.13,0:24:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if this is truly necessary,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.88,0:24:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,can' t I continue\Nas an outpatient?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.68,0:24:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.97,0:24:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,a fugue state\Nis a very serious event.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.77,0:24:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you were to disassociate\Nwhile you were driving?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.77,0:24:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you were\Nto get into a situation
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.40,0:24:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,where you could be shot\Nby the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.52,0:24:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand,\Nwe can' t allow you to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.40,0:24:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,until we're certain\Nwhat happened was\Na non-recurring event.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.70,0:24:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying you feel fine\Ndoesn't solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.45,0:24:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you tell me about\Npatient confidentiality?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.46,0:24:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Without your permission,\NI can't disclose anything\Nyou tell me to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What about my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.96,0:24:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not your family,\Nnot to the police.\NNot to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.47,0:24:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The only exception would be\Nif you threatened to kill someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'd be able to tell that person,\Nbut only that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.77,0:24:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And you,\Nas a medical practitioner,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.06,0:25:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you abide by these\Nstrictures absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.44,0:25:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.07,0:25:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no fugue state.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.87,0:25:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.50,0:25:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.80,0:25:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand to spend\Nanother second in that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.63,0:25:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had to get out,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.72,0:25:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and so I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.14,0:25:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think about it.\NI just did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.52,0:25:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I walked for a long time,\Nand when I couldn't walk\Nanymore, l hitchhiked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.77,0:25:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I got as far as Gallup...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.03,0:25:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and then it was just time\Nto come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.33,0:25:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.12,0:26:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,being found naked\Nin a supermarket,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.16,0:26:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that was your way of\Ngiving credibility to a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.88,0:26:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Of avoiding questions\Nabout your disappearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.80,0:26:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you feel\Nyou had to run from?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.90,0:26:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, my wife\Nis seven months pregnant
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.07,0:26:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,with a baby we didn't intend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.11,0:26:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My 1 5-year-old son\Nhas cerebral palsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.99,0:26:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an extremely overqualified\Nhigh school chemistry teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.54,0:26:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When I can work,\NI make $43,700 per year.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.54,0:26:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have watched\Nall of my colleagues
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.75,0:26:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and friends surpass me\Nin every way imaginable,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.38,0:26:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and within 1 8 months,\NI will be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.39,0:26:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And you ask why l ran?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.31,0:27:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[BELL DINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.96,0:27:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NGomie, you wanna do the honors?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.34,0:27:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[GOMEZ SPEAKING IN SPANISH]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.89,0:27:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[BELL DINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.10,0:27:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?\NThat means yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.98,0:27:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes is a bell,\Nno is no bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.44,0:27:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, this is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.19,0:27:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at this dude, all right?\NHe doesn't even know what planet\Nhe's living on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.07,0:27:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor, are we on\Nthe planet Mars?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.78,0:28:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we on the\Nplanet Saturn?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.95,0:28:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we on the planet Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.25,0:28:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[JESSE SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.21,0:28:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor, is today Friday?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.84,0:28:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is today Monday?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.34,0:28:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is today Tuesday?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.68,0:28:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, seems like he' s all there.\NLet's go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.47,0:28:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.18,0:28:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,was this man at your\Nhouse yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.53,0:28:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor, was this man\Nat your house yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.00,0:28:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy right here,\Nhe was at your house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.13,0:28:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he doing business\Nwith your nephew Tuco?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.21,0:28:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Señor, are you scared\Nof this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.80,0:29:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.98,0:29:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Granddad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.39,0:29:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna\Nhelp us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.99,0:29:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[DEFECATES]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.33,0:29:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.96,0:29:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.59,0:29:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.51,0:29:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,GOMEZ:\NI told you, numbnuts.\NThis guy's OG.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.47,0:29:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NOh, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.68,0:29:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kept his mouth shut for\N1 7 years in San Quentin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.68,0:29:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stroke or no stroke,\Nold-school gangbang\NMexicans don't help the feds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.94,0:29:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK: All right already.\NIt was worth a try at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.02,0:29:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,GOMEZ:\NWe gotta kick Pinkman loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.19,0:29:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.\NHe's nobody anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.28,0:29:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you telling me\Nyou buy that lame-ass\Nstory of his?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.61,0:30:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I buy that lame-ass story\Nmore than I buy he had\Nanything to do
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.11,0:30:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,with shooting Tuco, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.04,0:30:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NDad? Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.83,0:30:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.83,0:30:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, yeah, no,\NI'm fine. Hey, l'm, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.05,0:30:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's--?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.25,0:30:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She did? No, I didn't\Nget any messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.42,0:30:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I actually
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.38,0:30:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,lost my phone, and I've been\Ntoo busy to get a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.30,0:30:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been busy as--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.76,0:30:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As totally productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.81,0:30:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know what?\NI'm actually zeroing in\Non a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.31,0:30:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, data entry,\Nlike we talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.81,0:30:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l'm totally amped.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.48,0:30:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, could you give me a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.07,0:30:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually-- I'm downtown\Nand my car's in the, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.33,0:30:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Yeah, hey,\Nthat's cool. I will--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.50,0:30:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you later\Nwhen you have some...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.00,0:30:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Yeah. No. I, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.17,0:31:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.01,0:31:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.85,0:31:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.85,0:31:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are you doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.86,0:31:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Waffle House?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.90,0:31:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Waffle House is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.05,0:31:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.94,0:31:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.15,0:32:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay phone, in the middle\Nof nowhere, nobody followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.03,0:32:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So how did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.23,0:32:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.94,0:32:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.65,0:32:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They sweated me plenty,\Nbut they finally cut me loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.24,0:32:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So you getting out of there?\NTomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.70,0:32:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So who came for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.91,0:32:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The DEA?\NWhat did they ask you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.87,0:32:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the thing, you know.\NYour scumbag brother-in-law
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.54,0:32:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,took my rainy-day fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.25,0:32:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your what? What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.26,0:32:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My rainy-day fund.\NSixty-eight thousand, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.76,0:32:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cue-ball son of a bitch\Nlaughed in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.89,0:32:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I got like 80 bucks\Nto my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.01,0:32:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait.\NWhat does he know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.60,0:32:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he know\Nit' s your money?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.39,0:32:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, man.\NHe doesn't know shit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.10,0:32:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.81,0:32:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.27,0:32:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I got bills due, man.\NI'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.94,0:32:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he mention my name?\NNo. Thanks for caring.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.45,0:32:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.91,0:32:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.37,0:32:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And the RV?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.50,0:33:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Badger's cousin took it\Nto his garage. It' s safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.58,0:33:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he get it running again?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.13,0:33:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?\NSo we can cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.97,0:33:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So you still wanna cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.93,0:33:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.10,0:33:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's changed, Jesse?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.68,0:33:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[HANGS UP RECEIVER]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.65,0:33:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT: Seven-hundred\Nthirty-seven thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.53,0:33:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-one pounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.70,0:33:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,minus cash on hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.87,0:33:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cash on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.43,0:35:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.78,0:35:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOBlLE CHlMES]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.75,0:35:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHIMES]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.35,0:36:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[CRUTCHES CLlNKlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.65,0:36:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.73,0:36:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, honey. Did I wake you?\NNo, I was awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.15,0:36:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Want some cornflakes?\NUh, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.54,0:36:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.51,0:36:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[THE BE GOOD TANYAS' "WAITING\NAROUND TO DlE" PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.62,0:38:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.54,0:38:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Southwest Aniline again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.00,0:38:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.21,0:38:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the blue meth we found\Nup by your late homey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.75,0:38:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuco wasn't my homey, any more\Nthan Charlie Manson was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.42,0:38:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lab says it got cooked,\NP2P-style.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.34,0:38:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,P2P, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.47,0:38:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.26,0:38:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The two stooges over here\Ncooked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.97,0:38:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Lab said that blue meth's\Nthe purest they' ve seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.48,0:38:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,At least since this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.48,0:38:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Krazy-8.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.15,0:39:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Krazy-8, Tuco...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.70,0:39:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, some way,\Nit' s all connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.78,0:39:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A simple explanation,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.20,0:39:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,only l'm not seeing it,\Nand it's making my head hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.00,0:39:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because you're working\Nthat ugly melon too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.75,0:39:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dead around here.\NLet's go get a couple of beers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.54,0:39:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 1 1 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.34,0:39:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.59,0:39:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re buying? Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.01,0:39:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What, is it\NCinco de Mayo already?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.34,0:39:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.22,0:39:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,ALL:\NSurprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.68,0:39:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, you little\Nsneaky bastard, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.19,0:39:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.48,0:39:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.86,0:39:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?\NMAN 1 : Look what we got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.53,0:39:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Look at that,\NI love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.65,0:39:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They got the gut right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.86,0:39:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.\NMAN 2: There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.07,0:39:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks, man.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.95,0:39:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We all got you a little something,\Nand this is from all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.96,0:39:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.71,0:40:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you sick, sick puppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.42,0:40:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.35,0:40:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You going to finish\Nyour apple juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.97,0:40:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, thanks, buddy.\NYou take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.06,0:40:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re supposed\Nto drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.06,0:40:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The nurse said you\Nhave to stay hydrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.07,0:40:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.90,0:40:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad. Drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.66,0:40:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,[KNOCKlNG ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.08,0:40:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.29,0:40:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Better late than\Nnever, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.25,0:40:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.34,0:40:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How you doing, buddy?\NYou all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.26,0:40:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the mark of\Nthe beast there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.51,0:40:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.\NMarie stopped by this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.89,0:40:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They really cheer the place up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.35,0:40:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I ran into\NSky downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.15,0:41:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They' re rounding up\Na wheelchair for you,\Nyou freeloading bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.11,0:41:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT JR.:\NSo tell us about the shootout.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.11,0:41:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I was, you know,\Njust doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.66,0:41:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whole thing was over\Nin about five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.33,0:41:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Walt, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.45,0:41:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.91,0:41:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.37,0:41:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, l'm feeling fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.29,0:41:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?\NYeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.63,0:41:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor is calling it a...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.72,0:41:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,An isolated episode of\Ntransient global amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.97,0:41:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.72,0:41:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means\Nnon-recurring.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.52,0:41:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Non-- Well, non-recurring.\NThat sounds good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.93,0:41:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds real good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.52,0:41:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what,\NI'm glad you' re back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.15,0:41:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you really\Ngave us a scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.40,0:41:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.15,0:41:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what\Nto say. l mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.99,0:41:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you going out there\Nlooking for me put you\Nin danger, and l'm so--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.12,0:41:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry doesn't\Neven cut it. Not nearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.00,0:42:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Is that what\Nyou' re worried about?\NForget it. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.79,0:42:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the office,\Nthey' re treating me like\NI'm Eliot Ness, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.42,0:42:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, they threw me\Na party, the gals baked me\Na chocolate-chip cake
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.92,0:42:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,like you wouldn' t\Nbelieve, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.76,0:42:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you ought to\Ndisappear more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.84,0:42:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[HANK LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.51,0:42:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.\NDon't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.06,0:42:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Oh, hey, look.\NLook what they gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.98,0:42:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what\Nthey gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.77,0:42:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT JR.:\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.19,0:42:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha. That, gentlemen,\Nis the grill of the guy I shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.69,0:42:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,His grill?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.32,0:42:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It kind of goes over\Nthe front teeth like that,\Nyou know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.11,0:42:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sort of a fashion\Nstatement, l guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.58,0:42:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, certain folks\Nare attracted to shiny things.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.45,0:42:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.41,0:42:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.88,0:42:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.48,0:43:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you how good\Nit feels to be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.45,0:43:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get these in the wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.58,0:43:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.36,0:43:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.49,0:44:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, honey, l...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.91,0:44:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about\Ngoing out to 7-Eleven.\NDo you need anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.88,0:44:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Gulp? Slim Jim?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.48,0:44:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.36,0:44:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This will not happen\Nagain, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.53,0:44:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.91,0:44:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still here. I'm me,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.49,0:44:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and we're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.88,0:44:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.51,0:44:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,do you have a second\Ncell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.72,0:45:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A second cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.47,0:45:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The night you disappeared,\Nyou came in when I was\Ntaking a bath
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.85,0:45:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and you were very upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.81,0:45:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like something\Nterrible had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.94,0:45:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And then your\Ncell phone rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.98,0:45:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you check the number,\Nand then you got up
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.40,0:45:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.91,0:45:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.33,0:45:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And when Hank\Nchecked your phone records,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.83,0:45:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,there was no call.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.29,0:45:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No call on the phone\NI know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.63,0:45:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.59,0:45:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That is odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.89,0:45:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't remember\Nany of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.56,0:45:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but one thing l am sure of is that\NI don't have a second cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.23,0:45:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.47,0:46:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
